.TH scw-demo-widget-create 1 "" "scw" "scw Manual"
.SH NAME
scw-demo-widget-create, scw demo widget create \- Create a widget
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscw demo widget create\fP <server-id ...> [arg=value ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new widget
in the demo namespace.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fBname=value\fP
The name of the widget [Required]
.TP
\fBzone=value\fP
Zone to target [Default: fr-par-1] [One of: fr-par-1, nl-ams-1]
.TP
\fBlegacy-flag=value\fP
An old flag [Deprecated]
.TP
\fB<server-id>\fP
The ID of the server
.SH EXAMPLES
.P
.B
Create a widget
.EX
scw demo widget create name=demo server-id=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
\fIscw-demo-widget-list\fP (1) \- List widgets
https://docs.scaleway.com/widget
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fISCW_ACCESS_KEY\fR
The access key of a token (create a token at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_SECRET_KEY\fR
The secret key of a token (create a token at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_ORGANIZATION_ID\fR
The default organization ID (get your organization ID at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_PROJECT_ID\fR
The default project ID (get your project ID at https://console.scaleway.com/iam/api-keys)
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_REGION\fR
The default region
.TP
\fISCW_DEFAULT_ZONE\fR
The default availability zone
.TP
\fISCW_API_URL\fR
URL of the API
.TP
\fISCW_INSECURE\fR
Set this to true to enable the insecure mode
.TP
\fISCW_PROFILE\fR
Set the config profile to use